			"notes": "So sorry for the delay. I've been working on big content ideas!\n\n## 🔧 Changes\n- Embedded [Registrar](<https://modrinth.com/mod/registrar>), a helpful backend tool for adding things to built-in registries. You do not need to install this manually.\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n- Added the 4 infested blocks to the `#blocks_motion_no_leaves` block tag.\n- Soul torches are now correctly marked for world generation post-processing.\n- Added the terms and conditions of the [*General Public License version 3*](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html) to the [*LGPLv3*](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html) license document."
